{
  "name": "VeyCall: Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "291e55a9-de52-5747-85c9-ae8f4bd7c112",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## VeyCall: Slack\n\nYour VeyCall agent answers messages in a Slack channel (a customer workspace, a shared channel, a support channel), **in the message's thread**.\n\n1. **New message** and **Reply in thread**: connect your Slack app (bot token with `chat:write`, `channels:history`; add the bot to the channel). Pick the channel in the trigger.\n2. **VeyCall node**: create a *VeyCall API* credential with your organization API key (`vc_live_…`, VeyCall dashboard; needs the *API and webhooks* activation), then pick your agent.\n3. Activate.\n\nMessages from bots (including this one) are skipped, so the agent never answers itself.\n\nTo make the agent step back when you answer in a thread, add a second Slack trigger on your own messages to **Record Business Reply** (VeyCall node). a customer yourself, **Record Business Reply** tells VeyCall: your agent steps back in that conversation for a few hours (its own replies are recognised and ignored).",
        "width": 540,
        "height": 520,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e25a6152-ce8f-5ece-8338-a73344ee075e",
      "name": "New message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slackTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "trigger": [
          "message"
        ],
        "watchWorkspace": false,
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f6d6934b-766f-5001-9a53-8a9189defb9c",
      "name": "From a person?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "4eff0157-155e-5311-a4c0-9632e8e65d37",
              "leftValue": "={{ !$json.bot_id && !$json.subtype && $json.text ? 'yes' : '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "205ff145-43fc-50f0-b351-7991a9f971fe",
      "name": "VeyCall answers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-veycall.veyCall",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "answer",
        "agentId": "",
        "channel": "slack",
        "conversationId": "={{ $json.channel }}:{{ $json.thread_ts ?? $json.ts }}",
        "messageId": "={{ $json.client_msg_id ?? $json.ts }}",
        "senderId": "={{ $json.user }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "audioSource": "none",
        "replyAs": "text",
        "additionalFields": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8ccaae94-9280-56ce-b36a-38475cd686b1",
      "name": "Reply to send?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "dcfaad0a-33be-50fa-a7c3-e87c23740dbf",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.reply?.text ?? '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "79597528-6e84-5421-85d0-e95d495b2f04",
      "name": "Reply in thread",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        880,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('New message').item.json.channel }}"
        },
        "messageType": "text",
        "text": "={{ $('VeyCall answers').item.json.reply.text }}",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false,
          "thread_ts": {
            "replyValues": {
              "thread_ts": "={{ $('New message').item.json.thread_ts ?? $('New message').item.json.ts }}"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
